  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 (EF10) / 1.1.0-preview.1 (EF11)\n- Ship separate EF10 and EF11 release lines from shared source. The EF10 package can also be used by net11.0 applications without upgrading EF. EF11 support is preview support.\n- Preserve native DuckDB array materialization under EF11 and validate matching migration and compiled-model tooling for each target.\n\n1.0.8\n- Configure geometry parameters through the provider-neutral DbParameter path so decorated ADO.NET connections preserve their parameter implementation and metadata. Tracks DuckDB.EFCoreProvider 1.25.0.\n\n1.0.7\n- Refresh NuGet discovery tags and track DuckDB.EFCoreProvider 1.14.0. No behavioural or public API changes.\n\n1.0.6\n- Build/packaging: ship SourceLink metadata, deterministic (CI) builds, and a .snupkg symbol package; enable NuGet package validation against the previous release. Documentation: correct the geometry storage description in the shipped IntelliSense — geometry is stored in DuckDB's native GEOMETRY column type (WKT is only the driver wire format), not WKT-in-VARCHAR. No behavioural or public API changes. Tracks core DuckDB.EFCoreProvider 1.0.22.\n\n1.0.5\n- Fill in the shipped IntelliSense XML docs: add summary/param/returns tags to the public entry points (`UseNetTopologySuite`, `AddEntityFrameworkDuckDBNetTopologySuite`) and the standard internal-API disclaimer to internal translator/plugin classes, matching the core package's earlier documentation pass. No behavioural or public API changes.\n\n1.0.4\n- Update Entity Framework Core dependencies from 10.0.8 to 10.0.9. No code or public API changes.\n\n1.0.3\n- Rename the package, assembly, and root namespace from `DuckDB.EFCoreDriver.NTS` to `DuckDB.EFCoreProvider.NTS`, tracking the core package rename. Replace `using DuckDB.EFCoreDriver.NTS...` with `using DuckDB.EFCoreProvider.NTS...`. No behavioural or public API changes beyond the names.\n\n1.0.2\n- Ship the IntelliSense XML documentation file in the package. No code changes.\n\n1.0.1\n- Initial NetTopologySuite spatial support for DuckDB.EFCoreProvider.",
